          {
            "date": "Jan 14, 2025",
            "id": "4f8592ed-0444-4de7-bbad-9f5bfbc41f0d",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for sharing your feedback, Mark. We are glad to hear that you had a great time and enjoyed the convenient location, heated pool, and golf cart. We apologize for the issue with the dishwasher but are pleased that we were able to assist by providing disposable items. We appreciate your understanding and would be happy to welcome you back for another stay. Kind regards, Benchmark Management",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Overall we had a great time, dishwasher was broken, but the management company was very accommodating and provided us with disposable silverware dishes and glasses. Great location, the heated pool was a positive and the golf cart was fun. Would definitely stay here again.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
