            "id": "8e368c51-e273-4c44-8ba0-8327feb63f0e",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your wonderful review, Ladalyn! We are thrilled to hear that you enjoyed your stay in our beautiful home and found the location to be great. It is always heartwarming to know that our guests appreciate the details, such as the fence around the property, which we believe adds an extra layer of convenience for furry friends. We appreciate your kind words and are delighted to hear that you would consider renting from us again. We look forward to welcoming you and your pup back for another enjoyable stay in the future.\n\nRegards,\nBenchmark Managment",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "I will definitely rent again. Beautiful home and great location. The fence around the property was a plus for my pup.",
